<Document>
	<name>Berkeley's largest private housing projects · 15 projects · 09-02 08:43</name>
	<description><![CDATA[Every project of 200+ units excluding UC and BART, visited south to north by nearest neighbour. A quarter-turn arc at each rather than a full orbit, so fifteen sites fit in one film. Camera-only: run build_tour_package.py to splice the geometry.]]></description>
